msgid "!!! note \"A3 device mapping\""
msgstr "!!! note \"A3 设备映射\""

msgid "Atlas A3 uses a dual-DIE design. This Quickstart exposes two Ascend device nodes for one selected A3 device, such as `/dev/davinci0` and `/dev/davinci1`."
msgstr "Atlas A3 采用 dual-DIE 设计。当前 Quickstart 为一个选定的 A3 设备暴露两个 Ascend device node，例如 `/dev/davinci0` 和 `/dev/davinci1`。"

msgid ""
"These two device nodes do not mean that Quickstart automatically uses\n"
"        `tensor_parallel_size=2`. Whether to enable parallelism depends on the specific model and deployment method."
msgstr ""
"这两个 device node 不代表 Quickstart 自动使用\n"
"        `tensor_parallel_size=2`。是否启用并行应由具体模型和部署方式决定。"

